    skos:definition "pH is a chemical property that designates acidity or alkalinity of a solution or formulation. It is relevant for some specialty silicone dispersions"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "This property is a measured result for an uncured polymer"@en ;
    mds:hasStudyStage "Sample" ;
    mds:inDomain mdsdom:Formulation .

